flowchart TD
    A[Current Store State] --> D[Decision Engine]
    B[Congestion Prediction] --> D
    C[Customer / Product Demand Forecasts] --> D
    E[Inventory Status] --> D
    F[Operational Rules & Constraints] --> D
    G[Staff / Checkout Availability] --> D

    D --> H[Generate Candidate Actions]

    H --> I[Evaluate Expected Impact]
    I --> J[Apply Constraints]
    J --> K[Prioritize Actions]

    K --> L[Recommended Action Plan]

    L --> M[Staff Dashboard]
    L --> N[Operations Agent - Later]

    M --> O[Staff Action]
    N --> P[Approved Tool / API Action]

    O --> Q[Outcome]
    P --> Q

    Q --> R[Measure Actual Result]
    R --> S[Update Store State]
    S --> D

    D --> T[Example: Prepare Assisted Checkout]
    D --> U[Example: Restock High-Demand Product]
    D --> V[Example: Promote Scan-and-Go]
    D --> W[Example: Prepare Cold Stock]

    T --> K
    U --> K
    V --> K
    W --> K
